        "action": "Remove duplicate at line 16499, optimize primary at line 11152"
      },
      "resolution_status": "fixed_deployed"
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "RC004",
      "problem": "crypto_provider_auth_failures",
      "root_cause": "Binance and Coinbase APIs return 401/451 errors due to invalid/missing API keys or rate limits; get_crypto_price_quorum() tried all providers sequentially, wasting 3-5 seconds on failures",
